OL,3,GNEWSAMasked men throw petrol bombs at
OL,4,Apolice car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police patrol car was attacked with
OL,7,Fpetrol bombs by three masked men in
OL,8,FCounty Tyrone on Saturday.
OL,10,FThe officers were patrolling the
OL,11,FBallycolman Estate in Strabane shortly
OL,12,Fafter 17:00 BST when the attack
OL,13,Fhappened.
OL,15,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,16,F(PSNI) said the men, who were dressed
OL,17,Fin black, each threw a petrol bomb at
OL,18,Fthe passenger side of the vehicle.
OL,20,FThe car sustained minor damage.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
